- The whole-value and streaming forms interoperate freely. A value which was compressed as a
- whole decompresses through a stream, and the output of a stream decompresses as a value.
+ Las formas de valor entero y de flujo interoperan libremente. Un valor que se comprimió entero se
+ descomprime mediante un flujo, y la salida de un flujo se descomprime como un valor.

- ### The formats
+ ### Los formatos

- Seven formats are provided, in four families:
+ Se proporcionan siete formatos, en cuatro familias:

- ```tabular
+ ```tabular

- column  Format
- column  Algorithm
- column  Framing
- column  Carried by
- row  `Deflate`  DEFLATE  none  ZIP entries
